Manage your evnx cloud account

Usage: evnx auth [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  register                Create an evnx cloud account
  login                   Sign in to evnx cloud
  logout                  Sign out of evnx cloud
  resend-verification     Send the email-verification link again
  key-bundle              Print the CI key bundle: your sealed key material, for EVNX_KEY_BUNDLE
  token                   Manage API tokens for CI/CD
  totp                    Manage two-factor authentication
  sessions                List and revoke active sessions
  devices                 Networks and browsers this account has signed in from
  status                  Show your account as the server sees it
  rotate-master-password  Change your master password
  undo-password-change    Undo a master password change, by proving the previous password
  download-data           Download everything the server holds about your account, as JSON
  delete-account          Delete your account and everything only you can reach
  help                    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --server <URL>  evnx server to talk to. Overrides EVNX_SERVER and config.toml
      --no-color      Disable colored output
  -q, --quiet         Print nothing on success. Findings, warnings, errors and requested data still print
  -v, --verbose       Enable verbose output
  -h, --help          Print help
  -V, --version       Print version

Full guide: https://docs.evnx.dev/cli/commands/auth
